{"id":"1392e4ae6d9e4b1c","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-bpp-closure.md","title":"Closure of BPP","display":"thm-bpp-closure — Closure of BPP","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-bpp-closure","aliases":["28-thm-bpp-closure","Closure Properties of BPP"],"display":"thm-bpp-closure — Closure of BPP","depends_on":["[[28-df-bpp]]","[[28-thm-bpp-amplification]]"],"source_book_location":"Complementation used in Theorem 7.15 proof; printed p.136; PDF p.162; union/intersection derived in-note","source_printed_pages":"136","source_pdf_pages":"162","source_status":"statement-checked","proof_status":"source-proof-not-fully-audited; local-proof-reviewed","source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"verification_status":"proved-in-note; R7","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-bpp-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-bpp-closure</span><span>Closure Properties of BPP</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-bpp-closure — Closure of BPP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"073a1a66749fa84e\" href=\"?note=073a1a66749fa84e\" title=\"28-df-bpp\">28-df-bpp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1165db05a0a23506\" href=\"?note=1165db05a0a23506\" title=\"28-thm-bpp-amplification\">28-thm-bpp-amplification</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Complementation used in Theorem 7.15 proof; printed p.136; PDF p.162; union/intersection derived in-note"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"136"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"162"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source-proof-not-fully-audited; local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note; R7"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BPP}\">\\(\\mathbf{BPP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"073a1a66749fa84e\" href=\"?note=073a1a66749fa84e\" title=\"28-df-bpp\">28-df-bpp</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline A=\\Sigma^*\\setminus A\">\\(\\overline A=\\Sigma^*\\setminus A\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A,B\\in\\mathbf{BPP}\\;\\bigl(\\overline A\\in\\mathbf{BPP}\\land A\\cup B\\in\\mathbf{BPP}\\land A\\cap B\\in\\mathbf{BPP}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A,B\\in\\mathbf{BPP}\\;\\bigl(\\overline A\\in\\mathbf{BPP}\\land A\\cup B\\in\\mathbf{BPP}\\land A\\cap B\\in\\mathbf{BPP}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>R6 历史证据边界：当时取补与并合界推导已复核，但放大步骤沿用上游一般 Chernoff 的证明限制，故当时未授予已核验依赖资格。R7 的 Chernoff 与有限 BPP 放大已具完整局部证明；下面取补、OR/AND 和并合界的论证现可独立闭合。原书来源仍只对应定理7.15中使用的补闭性，并、交是本地推导。</p>\n<p>取补直接翻转输出。先用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1165db05a0a23506\" href=\"?note=1165db05a0a23506\" title=\"28-thm-bpp-amplification\">28-thm-bpp-amplification</a> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=3\">\\(k=3\\)</span>、分别独立重复 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"145\">\\(145\\)</span> 次，将两个错误分别降到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/8\">\\(1/8\\)</span>，再对输出取 OR 或 AND；任一算法出错的并合概率至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/4&lt;1/3\">\\(1/4&lt;1/3\\)</span>。补闭性在定理 7.15 证明中使用，另外两项由上述本地推导。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-bpp","status":"resolved","id":"073a1a66749fa84e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-bpp]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-bpp-amplification","status":"resolved","id":"1165db05a0a23506","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-thm-bpp-amplification]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-bpp","status":"resolved","id":"073a1a66749fa84e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$A,B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$；$\\mathbf{BPP}$ 见 [[28-df-bpp]]；$\\overline A=\\Sigma^*\\setminus A$。","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-bpp-amplification","status":"resolved","id":"1165db05a0a23506","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"取补直接翻转输出。先用 [[28-thm-bpp-amplification]] 取 $k=3$、分别独立重复 $145$ 次，将两个错误分别降到 $1/8$，再对输出取 OR 或 AND；任一算法出错的并合概率至多 $1/4<1/3$。补闭性在定理 7.15 证明中使用，另外两项由上述本地推导。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{BPP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline A=\\Sigma^*\\setminus A","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall A,B\\in\\mathbf{BPP}\\;\\bigl(\\overline A\\in\\mathbf{BPP}\\land A\\cup B\\in\\mathbf{BPP}\\land A\\cap B\\in\\mathbf{BPP}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"k=3","display":false},{"tex":"145","display":false},{"tex":"1/8","display":false},{"tex":"1/4<1/3","display":false}],"bytes":1728,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-123","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"放大与集中：[[28-thm-bpp-amplification]]、[[28-thm-chernoff-bound]]、[[28-thm-bpp-closure]]。"}],"outgoing":["073a1a66749fa84e","1165db05a0a23506"]}